DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAnthony WeaverLace up your sho
 es for the third annual We Run Bayview 5K on Saturday\, October 17\, 2026\
 , a community-focused 5K organized by Young community Developers (YCD) cel
 ebrating movement\, wellness\, local businesses\, and the Bayview-Hunters 
 Point neighborhood.\nThe point-to-point race begins at Candlestick Point S
 tate Recreation Area and travels through Bayview’s iconic Third Street c
 orridor\, finishing at the District 10 Health Fest at the Southeast Commun
 ity Center. The course is designed for runners and walkers of all levels\,
  so whether you’re a seasoned runner or simply looking for a fun way to 
 get active with friends and family\, you’re welcome to join!\n\nBut this
  isn’t just a race. Every registration helps support the launch of a Hea
 lthy Food Bank initiative\, expanding access to fresh\, nutritious food an
 d wellness resources for Bayview residents.\nAnd there’s a tasty bonus: 
 every registered participant receives a meal voucher that can be exchanged
  for a meal at a participating local business along the Third Street corri
 dor. Run through Bayview\, celebrate at the finish line\, and then support
  neighborhood restaurants.\nAfter crossing the finish line\, participants 
 can also enjoy the District 10 Health Fest\, connecting with local organiz
 ations\, health resources\, and community partners. This event is family-f
 riendly\, pet-friendly and welcoming to runners\, walkers\, families\, and
  all fitness levels. The Bayview shuttle will also be available to t...\n\
 n$30.00\n\nTickets: https://raceroster.com/events/2026/139958/we-run-bayvi
 ew-5k\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/run-bayview-5k-2026-charity-run/\n
