DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T143000
DTSTAMP:20261018T111813Z
UID:dothebay-17355390@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Co-presented by Zyzzyva Magazine and Litquake\, San Francisco
 ’s Literary Festival\n\nThis year’s Litquake festival will take place 
 October 8th-24th! For more information about Litquake’s festival and yea
 r-round programs\, visit litquake.org.\n\nThe series wherein famous author
 s choose a film that intersects with their artistic obsessions.\n\nAndrew 
 Sean Greer is a Pulitzer Prize winning author whose humor\, warmth\, and c
 andor could ignite a room from the page. For this special Litquake Festiva
 l installment\, Greer introduces Amarcord\, the dramatic comedy directed b
 y Federico Fellini for this special matinee.\n\nFellini recreates his home
 town of Rimini in this carnivalesque film\, where the director satirizes h
 is childhood. Time magazine says: “Fellini is so bountiful with incident
  and observation that he makes most other filmmakers seem stingy.” Winne
 r of an Academy Award for best foreign-language film\, Amarcord remains on
 e of the director’s best-loved creations\, beautifully weaving together 
 Giuseppe Rottuno’s colorful cinematography\, Danilo Donati’s extravaga
 nt costumes and sets\, and Nino Rota’s nostalgia-tinged score.\n\nGreer
 ’s Villa Coco reaches a magical and madcap tone that is in kin with this
  Fellini film. In Villa Coco\, a young man takes an unspecified job with a
  charismatic elderly Baronessa at her crumbling villa in the Tuscan hills.
  David Sedaris says: “No one writing in English is funnier or more charm
 ing than Andrew Greer.”\n\nDoors open at 12:00 p.m.\n\nShow starts promp
 tly at 12:...\n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/zyzzyva-m
 ovie-matinee-with-ingrid-rojas-contreras-amarcord-35mm-tickets\nSource: Do
 TheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32106279/1ff6dee2-13bb-4dc1-90a8-fc0997566801.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T111813Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/zyzzyva-movie-matinee-with-ingr
 id-rojas-contreras-amarcord-35mm-tickets
END:VEVENT
