CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, October 17th 1-5pm at The Kilowatt in San Francisco
 \nWes Urbaniak & The Mountain Folk w/ Natasha James + JonEmery\nFREE SHOW\
 n\nWes Urbaniak\nWes Urbaniak is an amalgamation of songwriting\, storytel
 ling and unique craftsmanship. His music is real\, honest\, bold and a lit
 tle odd in the best way possible. The experiences of his life have created
  stories through his songs. He pushes the limits within the human mind whi
 le opening up the possibilities for the human spirit to explore what’s d
 welling within. His whole world is a wonderfully delirious imagination ren
 dered into reality. https://wesurbaniak.com/\nNatsha James\nNATASHA JAMES 
 is known for taking Roots music styles\, turning them on their head\, comb
 ining them\, and coming out with tunes that are completely unique but tota
 lly familiar at the same time. https://www.natashajames.com/\nChuck “Jon
 Emery” Dodds\nWTF Chuck “JonEmery” Dodds\, is a singer-songwriter kn
 own for walking the line between heart\, humility and humor\, delivering s
 ongs that are honest\, and unassumingly\, uplifting. https://whatthefuckch
 uck.com/\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/events/2856128494773
 032\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/bad-ass-bluegrass-kilowatt-sf/\nSour
 ce: Funcheap SF
