UID:funcheap-1640679@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerLaura LinFeeling stressed\, an
 xious\, & overwhelmed?\nWe live in an era where these feelings have become
  our norm when joy\, bliss and peace should be our baseline way of being i
 nstead.\n\nBreathwork is an embodiment practice where we use conscious bre
 athing to get grounded\, break down stagnant energy in our bodies and acce
 ss a clearer\, lighter\, calmer you.\nOur Facilitator: Laura Lin has a BS 
 in Human Development and is a Certified Health Coach. Her coaching trainin
 g is based on cognitive and somatic practices including principles from In
 stitute of Integrative Nutrition\, Isha Foundations’s Inner Engineering 
 yogic practices\, and Internal Family Systems’s parts work. She is also 
 a trauma informed breathwork facilitator through PAUSE Breathwork.\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://partiful.com/e/DN4GsjjetOKOWtUBI5q7?c=DcOdfRaA\nDetai
 ls: https://sf.funcheap.com/breathwork-invitation-slow/\nSource: Funcheap 
 SF
