 joy live music while you hang out\, grab some food\, and celebrate the sea
 son with your Mission Bay neighbors.\nMeet Your Neighbors: Our Harvest Fes
 tival is all about community! Stop by our neighborhood gathering area\, me
 et fellow Mission Bay residents\, and connect with your neighbors.\nFree S
