BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:October Forest Bathing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T180000
DTSTAMP:20261018T111813Z
UID:dothebay-17955875@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
DESCRIPTION:Please dress in warm layers and bring water. Due to the slow a
 nd contemplative nature of this experience\, we recommend participants be 
 at least 12 years of age.\n\nImmerse yourself in the serene beauty of the 
 natural world on a forest bathing walk. Inspired by the Japanese tradition
  of shinrin-yoku\, this mindful\, slow-paced journey invites participants 
 to engage all senses connecting deeply with the sights\, sounds\, and text
 ures of the forest\, guided by prompts to pause and notice the intricate d
 etails of leaves\, the soothing rhythm of bird songs\, and the earthy scen
 t of the soil lowering stress levels\, reducing blood pressure\, and enhan
 cing overall well-being.\n\nBeneficial beyond relaxation\, this practice h
 onors and deepens our relationship with the Earth\, inviting us to recogni
 ze our part in the intricate web of life by slowing down\, attuning to nat
 ure\, and inspiring a sense of stewardship and gratitude. This walk is not
  about exercise or reaching a destination - it's about being fully present
  and experiencing the healing\, rejuvenating power of nature. In a world w
 ithout separation\, such connection includes connecting with other humans 
 through sharing and bearing witness to our shared experience. Whether you'
 re seeking stress relief\, emotional balance\, or simply a deeper connecti
 on to the natural world\, a forest bathing walk is a simple yet profound w
 ay to nurture both body and soul.\n\n$30-$50.\n\nPresented by Gardens of G
 olden Gate Park\n\n$30-$50.\nGardens of Golden Gate Park\n\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/october-forest-bathing-tickets\nSource: 
 DoTheBay
GEO:37.7659829;-122.466466
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34957769/5997ac51-a097-4b2b-a9da-883c193ab001.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T111813Z
LOCATION:San Francisco Botanical Garden\, 9th Ave & Lincoln Way\, San Fran
 cisco\, CA\, 94122
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/october-forest-bathing-tickets
END:VEVENT
