SUMMARY:Adrian West Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T213000
DTSTAMP:20261017T204148Z
UID:funcheap-1640754@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Live Music Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAdrian WestSix-piece Adrian We
 st Band returns to The Fourth Bore Taproom & Grill in Orinda! We’ll play
  a fun mix of originals\, instrumentals and covers + a couple jazz tunes. 
 Free show from 6:30 – 9:30pm. All ages welcome.\nInstrumentation: 2 voca
 lists\, acoustic guitar\, elec. violin\, piano\, upright bass\, alto sax\,
  drums\, percussion\, live looping\n\nAdrian West – vocals\, acoustic gu
 itar\, elec. violin & live looping\nMichael Echaniz on piano\nTBD – voca
 ls\, percussion\nChris Haag – alto sax\nAaron Germain – upright bass\n
 Andrew Griffin – drums\nOakland-based Adrian West Band is an up-to-six-p
 iece acoustic rock ensemble that plays catchy originals\, fun instrumental
 s\, the odd cover song and a little jazz. To some they sound like a cross 
 between Paul Simon and Talking Heads.\nAdrian enjoys setting philosophical
  lyrics to joyful music. His topics may veer a tad dark at times but the u
 nderlying music is uplifting\, giving the listener a richly layered experi
 ence. Whether he’s telling a story about a skinny-dipping episode gone a
 wry or grappling with some major challenge facing humanity\, his lyrics ar
 e infused with equal parts hope\, realism and whimsy.\nMore info about the
  band at www.adrianwest.com\nThe Fourth Bore Taproom & Grill offers Americ
 an mains\, cocktails & housemade beers served in chill industrial-edged br
 ewpub with a patio. More info at www.thefourthbore.com\n\nFree\n\nTickets:
  https://adrianwest.com\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/adrian-west-band
 -34/\nSource: Funcheap SF
