BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Manny’s Neighborhood Trash Cleanup” w/ $1 Beer & Free Yoga 
 Classes\, Free Fries
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T110000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1633249@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Free Food
DESCRIPTION:“Manny’s Neighborhood Trash Cleanup” w/ $1 Beer & Free Y
 oga Classes\, Free Fries (SF)\nManny's\nTired? Sunday Funday. Wired? Sunda
 y done-day. Make our neighborhood better\, brunch with cool people (sorry 
 not sorry\, we’re biased)\, get deals to some fave local spots\, and wra
 p it up before the Sunday Scaries hit with an easy hour of picking up tras
 h around our neighborhood with friends and the community!\nRSVP to save yo
 ur spot\nSF Public Works\, TogetherSF\, Shine On SF\, and Manny’s is hos
 ting a weekly neighborhood trash pick up to help keep our area clean and n
 eat.\n\nBy picking up with us\, you’ll get a special certificate that in
 cludes a whole host of neighborhood discounts valid that day\, including:\
 n\n$3 well highballs and $1 PBRs – Blondies\nHalf price shots (specific 
 shots only) – Bond Bar\nFree Tasty Small Fries – Beehive Bar\nOne free
  Yoga Class – HAUM Yoga\nOne free Yoga Class – Love Story Yoga\n2 for 
 1 empanadas – Venga Empanadas\nOne drink ticket (beer or wine) – Curio
  Bar\nFree Small Hot Chocolate – Dandelion Chocolate\n2 for 1 draft beer
  – Standard Deviant\nFrozen margarita with any additional purchase – W
 est of Pecos\nPlease note that the discounts might vary!\n\nWe’ll provid
 e the gear. All you need to bring is yourself(and maybe the two or three f
 riends you get to sign up to enjoy those 2-1 empanadas). When we’re done
 \, and before you settle in for those dollar margs\, join us for brunch to
  support Farming Hope – the non-profit restaurant at Manny’s! Don’t 
 forget to bring layers and comfo...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://refuserefu
 sesf.org/cleanups\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/mannys-neighborhood-tr
 ash-cleanup-w-1-beer-free-yoga-classes-free-fries-sf-154/\nSource: Funchea
 p SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/thumbn
 ail_IMG_6786.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Manny’s\, 3092 16th St San Francisco\, CA 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/mannys-neighborhood-trash-cleanup-w-1-beer-fre
 e-yoga-classes-free-fries-sf-154/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Brain Brew Community Day: Brain Games\, Lunch & Coffee
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T150000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639723@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Free Food
DESCRIPTION:Brain Brew Ride / Krishna BhattSpend a Sunday exploring the br
 ain\, sharing a meal and connecting with your neighbors at Brain Brew Comm
 unity Day—a free\, family-friendly event at Buchanan YMCA.\nJoin us on S
 unday\, October 18\, 2026\, from 10 a.m. to 3 p.m. for hands-on brain-them
 ed activities\, “Brain Olympics” games\, local coffee sampling and lun
 ch. Visit the memory wall\, learn about brain health and enjoy time with f
 amily\, friends and neighbors.\nOrganized by high school students Krishna 
 Bhatt and Govind Krishnan\, Brain Brew brings generations together to rais
 e awareness of Alzheimer’s and Parkinson’s. Families\, older adults\, 
 students and care partners are welcome.\n\nAdmission is free\, and lunch i
 s included. Donations are optional (through recommended\, ~$25) and suppor
 t the Alzheimer’s Association and Michael J. Fox Foundation.\nWhen: Sund
 ay\, October 18\, 2026\, 10 a.m.–3 p.m.\nWhere: Buchanan YMCA\, 1530 Buc
 hanan Street\, San Francisco\nRSVP: https://forms.gle/TBYodKPwEr8REew2A\nQ
 uestions: krishbhatt2019@gmail.com\nThis listing is for the October 18 Com
 munity Day. The October 17 ride and October 24 Walk mentioned on the flyer
  are separate activities.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://brainbrewsf.org\nDet
 ails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-brain-brew-community-day-brain-games-lu
 nch-coffee-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/White-
 Black-and-Orange-Fun-Run-5k-Marathon-Race-Flyer-3.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Buchanan YMCA\, 1530 Buchanan Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-brain-brew-community-day-brain-games-lunc
 h-coffee-sf/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brain Brew Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T150000
DTSTAMP:20261006T172218Z
UID:funcheap-1640829@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Free Food
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBrain BrewBrain Brew is a yout
 h-led brain health initiative bringing a free\, interactive Community Day 
 to San Francisco. Visitors can take part in Brain Olympics\, hands-on neur
 oscience activities\, the Community Memory Wall\, brain-health demonstrati
 ons\, prizes\, food and cold brew\, and more.\nThe Community Day is part o
 f Brain Brew’s three-event brain health campaign across San Francisco. O
 n October 17\, the team will cycle a 22.4-mile route tracing the shape of 
 a human brain through the city\, followed by the free Community Day on Oct
 ober 18. On October 24\, the Brain Brew Crew will join the Walk to End Alz
 heimer’s San Francisco.\n\nCome for 20 minutes or stay for the afternoon
 . Admission is completely free.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://brainbrewsf.or
 g/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/brain-brew-ride-sf/\nSource: Funcheap
