 e to life.\n\nDesigned for beginning through experienced drummers\, Univer
 sal Drumming offers a welcoming space to build your skills\, deepen your r
 hythmic understanding\, and experience the connection\, vitality\, and joy
  of making music together.\nSchedule (Fall Series):\n• October 18 – Dj
 ole | Guinea\, West Africa\n• November 1 – Balady/Ayub | Egypt & the M
 iddle East\n• November 15 – Kassa | Guinea\, West Africa\n• December
  6 – Samba Reggae | Bahia\, Brazil\nPricing:\n• 4-Session Series: $120
 \n• Single Session: $35 advance / $40 at the door\n• Drum Rental: $5 p
 er session / $20 for the full series\nSpace is limited. Advance registrati
 on is strongly encouraged.\n\n$35.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta.com/ev
 ents/161225/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/4session-world-dru
