 r a Decade Old\nBarbara Jane Reyes\, Mia Alvar Noel Alumit\, Shirley Anche
 ta\; moderator: Edwin Lozada\n📍 Koret Auditorium\nLove at the Fiesta: R
 omance Fiction and Filipino American Joy\nCeleste Dador\, Maan Gabriel\, M
 aida Malby\, Mia Hopkins\n📍 Hormel LGBT...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://
 filbookfestival.org/schedule\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/filipino-am
 erican-intl-book-festival-2026-at-sf-main-library-oct-17-18/\nSource: Func
