 et/34356736/e1183a6b-157a-42f6-b86b-393c3b430f4c.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020T084210Z
LOCATION:Workshop\, 1310 Haight St\, San Francisco \, CA\, 94115
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/19/sewing-101-hemming-and-simple-r
 epairs-tickets
