SUMMARY:Tapas Tuesday – 10% Off all Spanish Tapas at Bota
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T210000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:funcheap-1641282@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Lgbtq
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBota Tapas & Paella BarBota Ta
 pas & Paella Bar near Downtown San Francisco and Union Square is doing “
 Tapas Tuesdays” and enjoy all of our delicious Spanish Tapas at 10% Off.
  Just mention “Tapas Tuesday” to our server before ordering to get the
  discount. If you are seeking authentic Spanish cuisine\, stop by and say 
 hi!\nAbout Bota Tapas and Paella Bar\n\nAs an age-old tradition dating bac
 k to the early 1800s\, Spanish travelers used “BOTA”\, or traditional 
 sheep-skinned repositories\, to transport and share their wine. The Spania
 rds historically thrived on the values of sharing and community: two ideal
 s that have buoyantly withstood the test of time. Tailored around these sa
 me ideals are Spain’s cuisine and the development of “tapas\,” style
  dining – where individuals share small plates and memories. From Sevill
 e to San Francisco\, and across the world\, our goal is to initiate more m
 emories – this is why and how we operate. Whether it be with your friend
 s or family\, we here at Bota sincerely hope that you enjoy this stop on y
 our journey.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.botasf.com/\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-tapas-bota/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_51
 18.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:Bota Tapas & Paella Bar\, 490 Geary Street\, San Francisco\, CA 9
 4102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/tapas-tuesday-10-spanish-tapas-bota/
END:VEVENT
