DESCRIPTION:Join us as we welcome Nara Aziza Smith (@naraaziza)\, the best
 -dressed culinary creator in digital media\, who is bringing her signature
  style to 80 delicious\, homemade family-friendly recipes in her debut coo
 kbook HOMEMADE. You may think you know Nara Smith—the glamorous outfits\
 , the soothing ASMR voice\, the beautiful family\, the seemingly effortles
 s approach to making food from scratch—but behind it all is a working mo
 m with a relatable goal: preparing nourishing whole foods for herself and 
 her family.\n\nTickets include a copy of the book\, the chance to get your
  copy personally signed\, and a photo with Nara.\n\nBook Passage Presents:
 \n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/21/nara-aziza-smith-homem
 ade-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.co
