 me! Join us for a cocktail party celebrating the US release\, with an arti
 st presentation at 7:15 PM. Books and prints will be available.\n\n​One 
 Lens is a 256-page coffee table book that traces the band’s evolution th
 rough the eyes of one photographer\, whose own practice evolved alongside 
 them\, from film to digital.\n\n​Featuring nearly 400 photographs\, many
  published for the first time\, this collection captures the energy of liv
 e performance and the quiet moments in between—revealing the humanity\, 
 friendship\, and passage of time behind one of the world’s most beloved 
 bands.\n\n​San Francisco is where Victoria Smith’s photographic journe
 y with Coldplay began in 2001. Now\, we’re celebrating where it all star
 ted.\n\n​Published by DK / Penguin Random House.\n\nFree w/ RSVP\n\nDeta
