DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerElena BorodkinaWhat if the wor
 ld’s most famous paintings got a Halloween makeover? Grab a glass of win
 e and find out\, brush in hand. What would the Mona Lisa look like as a va
 mpire\, or Van Gogh’s Starry Night over a haunted house? At this one-nig
 ht Halloween edition of ‘Your Masterpiece’ class\, you’ll pick a fam
 ous painting and give it your own spooky twist.\nAn artist guides you step
  by step\, so no experience is needed. Just bring your imagination\, and l
 eave with your own finished canvas to take home.\nAll materials are includ
 ed: canvas\, paints\, brushes and apron. Sip\, paint\, and get into the Ha
 lloween mood in a cozy studio in San Francisco. Costumes are welcome but o
 ptional.\n\n$25.00\n\nTickets: https://classbento.com/b/ce35\nDetails: htt
