CATEGORIES:Lecture/Education
DESCRIPTION:Discover the wisdom of the five elements-Earth\, Water\, Fire\
 , Air\, and Space-and how they influence balance\, resilience\, and everyd
 ay wellbeing. Each session explores one element through meditation and sim
 ple practices that participants can carry into daily life.\n\nGuided medit
 ation\nExploration of one element and its qualities\nReflection & journali
 ng prompts\nParticipants may attend the full series or individual sessions
