 nd more.\nThe Side Show\, featuring Glynn Washington the creator of SNAP J
 udgment\, a Stanford professor\, a working psychologist\, two Moth GrandSl
 am winners\, multiple musicians\, staged in a genuine circus tent!\nThe th
 eme is “That Sounded Good At The Time\,” featuring stories that will m
 ake you laugh\, cry\, and possibly sing and dance. A single musician will 
 accompany each storyteller on stage to help set the journey in motion. Thi
 s will be an amazing collaborative adventure.\n\nSeating 6:30 PM Show 7:30
  PM $30 in advance $35 at the door\nCard-Only Bar – Beer & Wine\nYou wil
 l be seated in the Big Top tent at Radium Runway. We recommend you arrive 
