DESCRIPTION:Coit Comedy\nThursday\, October 22nd | Columbus Cafe\n\nCoit C
 omedy is a live stand-up comedy show every last Thursday of the month in t
 he secret basement bar of historic Columbus Cafe in North Beach\, featurin
 g some of the best comics from the Bay and beyond.\n\nHosted by local come
 dians Stoyan Angelov and Sean Derum\, Coit Comedy features the best comics
  in the bay and beyond including comedians from Cobbs\, SF Punch Line\, Vi
 ce Land\, Comedy Central\, Sketch Fest and Don't Tell. The comedy show is 
 in the hidden speakeasy of Columbus Cafe and offers a warm intimate settin
 g.\n\nDoors open at 7:30PM and the comedy show starts at 8PM. Parking can 
 be hard to come by in North Beach\, so if you're driving\, you may want to
  factor in a little extra time for the hunt.\n\nUpon entering\, grab a dri
 nk at the upstairs bar and check in near the pool table in the back where 
 you'll head downstairs to the secret basement to enjoy the show!\n\nThis w
 eek's show features:\n\nJames Uyekawa\nAlly Vastano\nDavid Dominguez\nCame
 ron Frost\nDan Aguinaga\n\n$12 online - $15 at the door\, 21+\n\nTickets: 
