  cannot get enough of the retro vibe of the hit series Stranger Things. Ta
 ke a trip to the upside-down in the safety of the Dome Theater at The Tech
  Interactive. Experience the 1980s tunes and soundscapes from the show\, a
 ll reinterpreted in vibrant laser light.\nThis 57-minute shared experience
  brings people together for an electrifying night of inner child energy\, 
 connection\, and joyful discovery.\n\nLaser Stranger Things Season 5\nStra
 nger Things Intro\nUpside Down – Diana Ross\nRockin’Robin – Michael 
 Jackson\nKids\nFernando – ABBA\nLandslide (LUMIA) – Fleetwood Mac\nWil
