 oves Cry – Prince\nSisters\nHeroes – David Bowie\nPurple Rain – Prin
 ce (BEAMS)\n— ENCORES —\nHazy Shade Of Winter – The Bangles (BEAMS)\
 nShould I Stay Or Should I Go? – The Clash (BEAMS)\nEvent Details:\nDate
 s: Friday\, October 23\, Friday\, October 30\, and Saturday\, October 31\n
 Tickets: $16.00 (prices include taxes and fees)\nWhere: The Tech\, Dome Th
 eater (201 S. Market St.\, San Jose)\nSeating: Seating is not assigned. Pl
 ease arrive early to pick your preferred seats.\nSafety: For your safety\,
  no late arrivals will be permitted.\nParking: Ticket purchasers who park 
 at the Convention Center Garage or the 2nd and San Carlos Parking Garage w
 ill receive a $5 parking validation. Present your parking ticket at Visito
 r Services.\nParking Perk: Rec...\n\n$16.00\n\nTickets: https://eventvesta
 .com/events/165328/t/tickets\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/stranger-la
