DESCRIPTION:[MOVED FROM GREAT AMERICAN MUSIC HALL]\n\nGoldenvoice\, Great 
 American Music Hall\, & LIVE 105 Present\nDeep End World Tour\nJulia Wolf\
 nwith Bee Blackwell\n\nFriday\, October 23 | The Warfield\n\nJulia Wolf (a
 ka WOLF) is an indie-pop singer/songwriter\, born and raised in New York. 
 A prolific lyricist with a unique and captivating tone\, WOLF began releas
 ing short freestyles and snippets of her music on social media at the end 
 of 2019. Almost immediately she began garnering heavy buzz from both early
  adopter fans and industry professionals alike. In just over a year\, WOLF
  has accumulated over 40 million streams and has developed a passionate an
 d rabid fan base -- all out of her bedroom in Queens\, NY.\n\nAll Ages\nGo
 ldenvoice\, Great American Music Hall\, & LIVE 105 Present: Deep End World
  Tour\n\nTickets: https://www.axs.com/events/1407735/julia-wolf-tickets?sk
 in=goldenvoice?cid=usaffdostuff\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026
 /10/23/julia-wolf-with-bee-blackwell-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
