CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Ray of Light TheatrePowered entirely by the iconic hits of Bri
 tney Spears\, Once Upon a One More Time is a dazzling\, pop-fueled musical
  that flips classic fairy tales on their heads. When Cinderella begins to 
 question her storybook destiny\, she discovers a magical book that introdu
 ces her— and the rest of the princesses—to modern ideas about independ
 ence\, choice\, and rewriting your own narrative.\nAs Snow White\, Sleepin
 g Beauty\, Little Mermaid\, and more begin to challenge their traditional 
 roles\, the land of fairy tales erupts into a joyful revolution set to cha
 rt-topping anthems like …\nBaby One More Time\, Toxic\, Stronger\, and O
 ops!… I Did It Again. What unfolds is a high-energy celebration of self-
 empowerment\, friendship\, and the courage to take control of your own sto
 ry.\n\nBold\, funny\, and irresistibly fun\, Once Upon a One More Time is 
 a glittering spectacle that blends nostalgia with modern feminism\, provin
 g that princes are optional-but owning your power is not. Get ready to dan
 ce\, sing along\, and see fairy tales through a totally new lens.\n\n$41.0
 0\n\nTickets: https://www.rayoflighttheatre.com/britney\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/sfs-wild-britney-spears-musical-time-oct-24nov-11/\nSource
 : Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screen
 shot-2026-10-02-at-1.03.38-PM.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T214235Z
LOCATION:Barbary Stage\, 215 Jackson St\, San Francisco\, CA 94111
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-wild-britney-spears-musical-time-oct-24nov
 -11/
END:VEVENT
