  enjoy the festivities\, Mutt Strut is a tail-wagging good time for a grea
 t cause.\nEvent Highlights\nCommunity dog walk\nPet costume contest\nVendo
 r booths and community partners\nMusic and entertainment\nFamily-friendly 
 activities\nPhoto opportunities\nRaffles and giveaways\nDog-friendly fun f
 or all ages\n\n$42.50\n\nTickets: https://nhsfoundation.org/events/mutt-st
