 rid event. Registration is required for Zoom attendance. In-person attenda
 nce does not require registration\; seats available first come\, first ser
 ved.\n\nTopics include investing\, income tax updates\, property tax and i
 ntergenerational transfers\, resources to strengthen your financial skills
