DESCRIPTION:Get ready to dumpling like never before! Kikkoman\, the #1 soy
  sauce brand in the U.S.\, is thrilled to sponsor the 3rd annual World of 
 Dumplings food festival\, organized by Asians Are Strong (AAS). World of D
 umplings celebrates our different cultures and communities through our sha
 red love of dumplings\, highlighting our similarities and celebrating our 
 delicious differences. Join us at the San Francisco Ferry Building for a f
 ull day of legendary flavors and bold umami\, with dumpling testings\, gam
 es\, and hands-on fun at every turn.\nWhat’s Cooking at Our Booth\n-Dump
 ling Tastings with Kikkoman: Snag a bite of dumplings at our booth during 
 four sessions: 12:00\, 1:00\, 2:30\, and 3:30 PM. They go fast\, so don’
 t wait!\n-Kikkoman Umami Bar: Take your dumplings to the next level. Dip\,
  drizzle\, mix and match from our extensive lineup of Kikkoman sauces—so
 y sauce\, teriyaki and ponzu—to find your perfect pairing and taste bold
  umami in every bite.\n-Games & Giveaways: Drop in and play to win prizes 
 at the Kikkoman booth while supplies last!\n-Sand Art Crafting: Fill an em
 pty soy sauce dispenser with colorful sand and decorations to create your 
 very own keepsake. Only at 2-3 PM\, and while supplies last.\n-Soy Sauce D
 ispenser & Mascot Collaboration: Meet our mascot and check out the special
  dispenser collaboration. Photo op\, anyone?\nTaste Kikkoman Across the Fe
 stival\nLook for Kikkoman sauce packets (Soy Sauce\, Teriyaki BBQ Sauce Or
 iginal\, and Ponzu) at the booths of festival favorites Palette Te...\n\nP
 ublished by San Francisco Bay Area Moms\nContains information from CalDisc
 overy (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sanfranciscomoms.c
 om/event/dip-drizzle-mix-world-of-dumplings-festival-with-kikkoman/?utm_so
 urce=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: Ca
 lDiscovery
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T045844Z
LOCATION:Ferry Building\, 1 The Embarcadero\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sanfranciscomoms.com/event/dip-drizzle-mix-world-of-dumplings-
 festival-with-kikkoman/?utm_source=caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaig
 n=san-francisco-ca
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Leap’s 44rd Annual Sandcastle Classic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T130000
DTSTAMP:20261023T114720Z
UID:dothebay-17979913@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:Genentech Presents\nLeap’s 44th Annual Sandcastle Classic\nS
 aturday\, October 24 | Ocean Beach\n\nSince 1983\, Leap has hosted the ico
 nic Sandcastle Classic\, Northern California’s largest sandcastle compet
 ition\, to raise funds for Bay Area arts education programs. This unique s
 andcastle competition\, nonprofit fundraiser\, and community event brings 
 over 5\,000 people to San Francisco’s Ocean Beach every year to design a
 nd construct creative sand sculptures on an impressive scale\, with local 
 students.\n\n2026 marks the 44th annual Sandcastle Classic\, the biggest s
 andcastle competition in Northern California.\nTeams typically comprised o
 f architects\, engineers\, contractors\, designers\, corporations\, and lo
 cal elementary school students work together to build giant sand sculpture
 s. The funds raised by teams and sponsors make it possible for us to conti
 nue to provide arts programs to Bay Area students.\n\nThousands of people 
 come out to Ocean Beach for Leap’s annual Sandcastle Classic\, which is 
 free to the public to attend.\n\nThe event is covered by regional print an
 d online media\, and celebrity judges evaluate the final sand sculptures.\
 nMore than 25 local schools and 500 donating companies and advertisers par
 ticipate.\n\nThe highest grossing team in the event’s history raised $60
 \,000.\n\nThis year\, we’re accepting a maximum of 30 teams. Sign up ear
 ly to reserve your spot!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://leapsandcastleclassic
 .org/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/leaps-44rd-annual-s
 andcastle-classic-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\nAlso listed on:\n- https://
 sf.funcheap.com/leap-arts-annual-sandcastle-classic/\n- https://sfchildren
 nature.org/event/join-the-43rd-annual-leap-sandcastle-classic/?utm_source=
 caldiscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca
GEO:37.7711664;-122.5111395
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35070125/0bdea64f-bfe7-4001-9fea-1a47c345f857.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T114720Z
LOCATION:Ocean Beach\, 1001 Great Hwy\, SAN FRANCISCO\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/leaps-44rd-annual-sandcastle-cl
 assic-tickets
END:VEVENT
