 ildren\, or just looking for a great time.Ticketed Activity Zone: The Tick
 eted Activity Zone will feature a variety of hands-on activities and enter
 tainment for kids and pets\, with proceeds benefiting the Junior League of
  Oakland-East Bay.\nTouch-a-Truck Zone: Little ones can get up close to un
 ique vehicles and enjoy a hands-on experience that puts them in the driver
 ’s seat of the fun.\nKids Fun Zone: Bounce\, create and play with a gian
 t inflatable bounce house\, family-friendly crafts and activities\, plus a
  special meet-and-greet and performance with three Witchy Sisters. And\, o
 f course\, don’t miss the Kids Costume Contest!\n\nEntertainment: Keep t
 he Halloween vibes going with beats by DJ BeetleJack Juice\, onsite from 1
 2–4pm.\nPet Fun: Four-legged friends can join in the Halloween fun with 
