DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T170000
DTSTAMP:20261022T120138Z
UID:funcheap-1642230@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerPam WongExplore the stories of
  activists who stood up for justice in this sweeping story of a historic b
 uilding in San Francisco’s Japantown. The Japanese YWCA building\, at wh
 ich this performance takes place\, is a testament to the power of everyday
  people to enact change.\nJoin us for a multimedia performance incorporati
 ng taiko drumming\, contemporary dance\, jazz\, poetry\, and narration.\n\
 nIn Their Footsteps is directed by Melody Takata and features San Francisc
 o Poet Laureate Genny Lim\, jazz musicians Francis Wong and Lewis Jordan\,
  dancer Hien Huynh\, actor Suz Takeda\, and youth and adult taiko drummers
  from GenRyu Arts.\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://www.genryuarts.org/events
 /in-their-footsteps/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/footsteps-legacy-is
 sei-women-japanese-ywca-building/\nSource: Funcheap SF
