 ritual object from the Indigenous Huichol people of Mexico\, then make you
 r own “God’s eye” to take home.\nCraft & Learn: Ojo de Dios\nSaturda
 ys\, October 24 & 31\, 2026 | 2p\nTruhlsen-Marmor Museum of the Eye\, 645 
