UID:dothebay-17805500@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:The lights go down and the lineup stays classified until it hi
 ts the screen. Prepare for at least four blood-soaked films (the final sla
 te is up to your local programmer)\, including at least one newly restored
