DESCRIPTION:UNDSCVRD Golden Hour Night Market\nSaturday\, October 24 | 330
  Ritch Street\n\n​Ten years ago\, Undiscovered started the trend of nigh
 t markets. Now\, we return during golden hour.\n\n​This year marks a spe
 cial milestone — join us as we celebrate 10 seasons of community\, creat
 ivity\, and cultural pride! For our second hub\, we are so excited to brin
 g back UNDISCOVERED SF Season 10: the Golden Hour Night Market in partners
 hip with Victory Hall.\n\n​Nestled in the fabled Ritch Street Alley\, Vi
 ctory Hall has been a cornerstone of SoMa since 1908 — home to the legen
 dary 330 Ritch Nightclub and a long legacy of music\, community\, and cult
 ure in partnership with Deanna Sison\, a culinary trailblazer\, a custodia
 n of Filipino tradition\, and an influential force in San Francisco's hosp
 itality scene.\n\n​On October 24\, we're honored to be part of that lega
 cy — filling Ritch Street with Filipino American food\, art\, music\, an
 d culture in the heart of the Filipino Cultural Corridor.\n\n#UNDSCVRDseas
 on10 #MadewithMahal\n\n​Come hungry. Come ready to move. Come discover.\
 n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/raipa01b\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/10/24/undscvrd-golden-hour-night-market-tickets\nSource: Do
 TheBay
