  in the pursuit of a little more life.\n\nJoin us at The Dogpatch Hub on O
 ctober 24 to learn simple\, practical mending skills like sewing on a butt
 on\, fixing a ripped seam\, and patching a hole\, all while hanging out wi
 th other creative\, like-minded people. No sewing experience or supplies n
 eeded!\nAnd because mending can do a little more good\, 100% of proceeds w
 ill go to the American Cancer Society.\nCome learn something useful\, brin
