DESCRIPTION:Bark at SPARK: Howl-O-Ween!\nSunday\, October 25 | SPARK Socia
 l SF\n\nGet ready to howl and growl at Bark at SPARK: Howl-O-Ween!\n\nCall
 ing all furry friends and spooky souls—it’s time to paw-ty! Bark at SP
 ARK: Howl-O-Ween! is a celebration of pups\, people\, and community. Come 
 meet fellow dog lovers\, make new friends\, and let your four-legged besti
 e make some new friends of their own—all while enjoying a day of Hallowe
 en fun\, festive activities\, and tail-wagging fun.\n\nJoin us at SPARK So
 cial SF on Sunday\, October 25\, from 11 AM–5 PM for a Halloween celebra
 tion dedicated to our four-legged friends. Shop spooky treats\, toys\, acc
 essories\, and more from local pet-loving vendors\, then join in on the fu
 n with our Pup Cup Races at 1 PM and 2 PM\, Costume Contest at 3 PM\, and 
 a Puppy Parade immediately following the contest. Dress up your pup\, brin
 g your pack\, and enjoy a day of festive fun!\n\nEvent Details:\n\nSunday\
 , October 25\, 2026 | 11am–5pm\nThe Field at SPARK Social SF | 601 Missi
 on Bay Blvd. North\, SF\nFree with RSVP\nAll pets must be on leash.\n\nFea
 turing:\n\nPet-tastic Vendors\n\nShop treats\, toys\, accessories\, and sp
 ooky goodies from local pet-loving businesses!\n\nPup Cup Race | 1pm & 2pm
 \n\nReady\, set\, lick! Each pup gets their own pup cup of whipped cream
 —first to lick it clean wins!\n\nCostume Contest | 3pm\n\nBring your bes
 t Halloween look and let your pup strut their stuff! Prizes will be awarde
 d to the most pawsome costumes.\n\nPuppy Parade | Following Costume Contes
 t\n\nGrab your leash and join...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.
 io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fbark-at-spark-howl-o-we
 en-tickets-1998393395441%3Faff%3Derelpanelorg\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/10/25/bark-at-spark-howl-o-ween-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n
 \nAlso listed on:\n- https://sf.funcheap.com/bark-spark-howloween-sf/
