UID:dothebay-17630535@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:The First Responder Support Network Inaugural Gala\n\nJoin us 
 for a powerful evening celebrating the courage\, sacrifice\, and resilienc
 e of our first responders. Public safety leaders\, community supporters\, 
 corporate partners\, and philanthropic guests will convene for a night of 
 connection\, recognition\, and impact while enjoying an elevated reception
 -style experience featuring an open bar\, gourmet food\, and live music.\n
 \nA short program of first-hand stories\, honoree/volunteer recognition\, 
 and a fund-a-need paddle raise will help support FRSN’s trauma informed 
 programs for first responders and their loved ones.\n\nThe celebration wil
 l continue with an After Party\, including desserts\, dancing\, drinks\, a
 nd live music by Martin Luther McCoy.\n\nDATE: Wednesday\, October 28\, 20
 26 (National First Responders Day)\nTIME: Starting at 5:30pm\nLOCATION: Sa
 n Francisco War Memorial & Performing Arts Center's Green Room\nATTIRE: Co
 cktail attire\, dress uniforms\nTICKET PRICE: $200 early bird\; $250 regul
 ar\; $150 for first responders\; $50 for After Party only\n\nPurchase a re
 served table for 8 and guarantee your group can sit together throughout th
 e evening. A limited number of reserved tables are available. Individual g
 ala seating is open and available on a first-come\, first-served basis.\n\
 nEARLY BIRD PRICING ENDS SEPTEMBER 1!\n\n$200 early bird\; $250 regular\; 
 $150 for first responders\; $50 for After Party only\nFirst Responder Supp
 ort Network\n\nTickets: https://onecau.se/frsninauguralgala\nDetails: http
 s://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/28/inaugural-gala-tickets\nSource: DoTheBa
 y
