CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Marking its 10th anniversary\, Jonás Cuarón’s DESIERTO is 
 a tense border thriller with the stripped-down intensity of survival horro
 r. When a group of migrants crossing the U.S.-Mexico border is hunted thro
 ugh the desert by an armed vigilante\, the journey becomes a brutal fight 
