  and cover hobby losses\, home offices\, self-employed health insurance\, 
 the new deduction for tips\, record keeping requirements and any updates t
 o the tax code for the most recent year.\n\nA Q&A will follow the presenta
 tion.\nThis event takes place in the Main Library (100 Larkin Street)\, on
  the 4th Floor in the Steve Silver Music Center.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https
 ://sfpl.org/events/2026/10/29/presentation-stressless-taxes-artists-creati
