 nearly\, grab a bite\, and make a night of it.\n\nAbout Jose Santamaria:\n
 Jose Santamaria has been a professional dance instructor and\nchoreographe
 r for more than 20 years. He has worked with leading instructors\nand trav
 eled throughout the United States and internationally to research Latin\nd
 ance techniques.\n\nHis experience has helped him develop a diverse and\nv
