DESCRIPTION:Late Night Editions: Halloween Eve\nFriday\, October 30 | de Y
 oung Museum\n\nLate Night Editions: Halloween Eve rises from the shadows a
 nd takes over the legendary de Young in the heart of Golden Gate Park. Wan
 der beneath towering redwoods and through haunting galleries for a night w
 here art\, music\, and mystery collide under the park’s twilight canopy.
 \n\nStroll the candlelit galleries while live DJ sets from In Session puls
 e through the halls. Delight in bites from Off the Grid food trucks\, mood
 y cocktails\, and immersive photo moments around every corner.\n\nCome dre
 ssed in your most art-inspired\, avant-garde costume\, and prepare for a w
 ickedly unforgettable night.\n\nTickets are limited and will vanish fast 
 — reserve yours before they sell out.\n\nEvent details\n\nGeneral admiss
 ion: $45\; VIP: $95\nGuests must be 21+ years of age.\nCapacity is limited
 . Advance reservations are strongly recommended. A current membership does
  not guarantee event access.\nEvent purchases are nonrefundable and nontra
 nsferable.\nTicket includes access to Treasures of the Pharaohs and the de
  Young’s permanent collection galleries. Exhibition access is not guaran
 teed.\nThis event features amplified live DJ music. Attendee discretion is
  advised.\nAdmission starts at 6 pm.\nAudio tours are not available during
  Late Night Editions: Halloween Eve.\nCostume safety and guidelines\nBy pu
 rchasing tickets\, you agree to abide by all museum costume policies. Cost
 umes and props must not touch or interact with any exhibitions\, artwor...
 \n\n21+\n\nTickets: https://www.famsf.org/events/late-night-editions-hallo
 ween-eve?utm_source=dothebay&utm_medium=partner&utm_campaign=latenightedit
 ionshalloween&utm_content=newsletter\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/10/30/late-night-editions-halloween-eve-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay\n\
