DESCRIPTION:Mission Rock Fall Friday Night Movies\nMovie nights are back a
 t China Basin Park! Gather your friends and family and join us Friday nigh
 ts this October for four cozy evenings of movies under the stars. Bring a 
 blanket to the Great Lawn\, grab your favorite movie-night snacks\, and se
 ttle in for a fun night at the park!\n\nOctober 9 — Inside Out\nOctober 
 16 — Ratatouille\nOctober 23 — Fantastic Mr. Fox\nOctober 30 — Coco\
 n\nMake a night of it at Mission Rock! Come early to grab dinner or drinks
  from our retailers\, enjoy the movie under the stars\, and stick around a
 fterward to keep the evening going. See you Friday nights at the park!\n\n
