SUMMARY:Halloween SF World Naked Bike Ride (Oct. 2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T220000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637655@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Sports Fitness
DESCRIPTION:@SFWNBR mARTyThe creepy menace of “politics” & “ai” & 
 “flock cams” political clowns got you down?\nWe’ve got just the righ
 t Big Pick Me Up Remedy\, Treat & CureRx in store for you just before the 
 Big S/Election coverage heats up!\nWe’re putting our peds to the pedal &
  a festive cap on the final 2026 Calendar of Sunny Seasonal San Francisco 
 World Naked Bike Rides which have been the funnest opportunity to Advocate
  for real Traffic Safety & ProTest to Save Our Planet — in #ThePureSuitO
 fHappiness ( or #BareAsYouDare ) & Tour Our Lovely City. As the San Franci
 sco Chronicle “covered” us in 2024 & noted: “Nudism is Freedom!”. 
 All are welcome to join our Saturday 31 October pre-S/Election HOWLloweeni
 e* Ride&AfterParty. *Old School San Franciscan aesthetes will catch the sl
 y reference to iconic Beat Poet – & Nudist Artist — Allen Ginsberg’s
  “HOWL” which is as prescient & relevant for this Election Season as i
 t has it has ever been\, since the 60’s\, for its passionate cry of rage
 \, grief\, & tribute against the rigid conformity\, capitalism\, & coldnes
 s of America.\n\nWe gather at 10am in Rincon “Cupid’s Arrow” Park\, 
 The Embarcadero Promenade & Folsom Street & roll out promptly at 12pm/Noon
  for an iconic & unforgettable tour of SF. ( Weather permitting\, check fo
 r updates! ). Our rolling AfterParty features several EveryDay/365 #Nudist
 WelcomingMerchants – from Cantata Coffee Co in the Haight Ashbury\; MrsL
 eather in SoMa\; & Hot Cookie\, Spike’s Coffee\, Hot Johnnies\, Castro S
 moke House & many more i...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://x.com/sfwnbr\nDeta
 ils: https://sf.funcheap.com/halloween-sf-world-naked-bike-ride-oct-2026/\
 nSource: Funcheap SF
