DESCRIPTION:Balboa Village Merchants AsscThe 12th Annual BalBOOa Fright Fe
 st is a neighborhood Halloween event along Balboa Street between 33rd and 
 41st avenues. Activities include trick-or-treating at participating busine
 sses\, a scavenger hunt\, pumpkin painting at Creative IQ\, hot chocolate 
 at La Promenade\, games\, and costume-related activities. Completed scaven
 ger-hunt sheets may be redeemed by 4:00 PM at Terra School yard or Full Li
 fe Christian Center.\nOriginal Event Description:\n_The 12th Annual BalBOO
 a Fright Fest is coming up on Saturday\, October 31st!\nJoin neighbors and
  local merchants as we Trick-or-Treat down Balboa Street from 33rd and 41s
 t Avenue! Stop by our beloved neighborhood shops\, show off your costumes\
 , and join the scavenger hunt!\nThe Balboa Village Merchants Association i
 s teaming up with local Balboa merchants\, Full Life Christian Church\, an
 d Terra School to create a fun Fall day in the neighborhood!\nVisit partic
 ipating Merchants along Balboa Street between 33rd to 41st Avenue to colle
 ct stamps for the scavenger hunt! Bring the completed sheet to the scaveng
 er hunt table at Terra School yard (Balboa & 39th Ave)\, or Full Life Chri
 stian Center (Balboa & 37th Ave) by 4pm to redeem your reward.\nActivities
 :\nTrick-or-Treat & Scavenger Hunt at participating businesses\nPumpkin pa
 inting at Creative IQ\nHot chocolate at La Promenade\nBucketheads: Pumpkin
  bucket art show at Eye and Hand Society 10/17\nGames at Full Life Christi
 an Center TBA\nGames at Terra School TBA\nCostume Contes...\n\nFree\n\nTic
 kets: https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddmld49y0tK/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link
 &amp\;stkn=NTc4MTIwNjQ2YQ==\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-12th-ann
