 AM - 10:30PM PDT\, with performers in Portugal\, Argentina\, Canada\, Seat
 tle\, Ohio\, Connecticut\, New Mexico\, Texas\, Petaluma\, Arkansas\, San 
 Francisco\, Ashland\, North Carolina\, The Catskills\, San Jose\, Maryland
 \, Montana\, San Diego\, Rhode Island\, Nevada City and plenty of talent f
 rom right here in The Bay Area!! Your ticket gets you onto The Zoom + into
  the party!! Get a ticket and join us in The Zoom\, and we'll donate 25% o
 f ticket sales to Bay Area Cancer Connections! We have a goal of raising a
 nd donating $100\, you can help make that happen by getting a ticket or ca
 n donate after clicking the tickets button.\n\nPlease get a ticket @ https
 ://bit.ly/oct26tickets and join us in the Zoom!\n\nThe show will feature:\
