DESCRIPTION:Comfort & JoyGlow in the Streets is a Halloween-night outdoor 
 dance party in San Francisco’s Castro District featuring DJ sets by Hil 
 Huerta and Sergio Fedasz\, drag\, dayglow and neon art\, a no-host bar\, a
 nd costume contests for kids\, pets\, and adults. The event includes immer
 sive art by Chickpea + V. Blue and prizes from local merchants for costume
 -contest winners. Attendees are encouraged to wear costumes and RSVP or do
 nate in advance.\nOriginal Event Description:\nCome discover a pocket univ
 erse of neon art and queer delights. Wear a costume and come out to Glow i
 n the Streets on Saturday\, October 31st from 5–10pm in the heart of the
  Castro!\nDJ sets by @hilhuerta and @sergioaudio _ RSVP or Donate to help 
 keep the streets of the castro queer: bit.ly/glow_tix\nThis event produced
  in partnership with the Office of the Mayor of San Francisco and Castro M
 erchants. Local sponsorship provided by La Méditerranée and Cliff’s Va
 riety.\nCome discover a pocket universe of neon lights and queer delights.
  Wear a costume and come on down to Glow in the Streets on Saturday\, Octo
 ber 31st from 5–10pm in the heart of the Castro District of San Francisc
 o.\n​We can’t wait to dance with you on Halloween Night!\n​— ∴ 
 —\n​Something wickedly queer this way comes! Comfort & Joy is bringing
  out the dayglow and invading the streets of the Castro.\n​Fashion-Forwa
 rd Costumery – Dress to impress and strut your stuff in the Costume cont
 est for your chance to win some clutch swag from local merchants!\n​Imme
 rsive A...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/eea3phxv\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/glow-streets-2026-outdoor-dayglow-neon-halloween-dance-pa
 rty-castro/\nSource: Funcheap SF
