 ration featuring spooky beers from Great Notion and Ghost Town Brewing\, a
  costume contest\, spooky music\, scary movies playing all night and plent
 y of Halloween fun!\n\nAlready have Halloween plans? Come kick off your ni
 ght with us before heading to your late-night parties. No plans? Even bett
 er! Hang out with your Taplands crew and celebrate with friends and neighb
