DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T201500
DTSTAMP:20261020T194441Z
UID:dothebay-17922935@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Labyrinth\, 1986 Directed by Jim Henson\n\nWHERE EVERYTHING SE
 EMS POSSIBLE AND NOTHING IS WHAT IT SEEMS.\n\nWhen teen Sarah is forced to
  babysit Toby\, her baby stepbrother\, she summons Jareth the Goblin King 
 to take him away. When he is actually kidnapped\, Sarah is given just thir
