DESCRIPTION:Sam HaynorUpdate! DANCEOWEEN 2026 is officially on. Expect 5\,
 000+ to join for this epically-fun roving mobile dance party through the M
 ission!\n🌕 🎃 DANCEOWEEN IS BACK! 🎃 a free\, roving dance party th
 at winds through the streets of the Mission with mobile sound carts\, live
  music\, bubbles and absurd costumes. The 2026 theme is Total Flanarchy\, 
 so expect flan-themed mischief alongside the usual magic.\nThe crowd gathe
 rs at the 16th St BART plaza at 7:30 PM\, then moves through the neighborh
 ood behind mobile sound carts with DJs and live music. Think bubbles\, glo
 wing art carts\, and thousands of people in wildly creative costumes danci
 ng together.\n\nCostumes are encouraged (the sillier the better). Wear com
 fy dancing shoes\, bring water and something that glows. It’s free and e
 veryone is welcome.\nDance-o-ween 2026\nSaturday\, October 31\, 2026 | 7:3
 0-11:30pm\n16th and Mission-ish\, SF\nFREE\n📍 Meet: 16th St BART plaza\
 , 7:30 PM sharp. The mob starts moving soon after!\n🧭 Route: winding th
 rough the Mission. RSVP here to get live text updates so you can find us i
 f you’re late. 📲\n🎒 Bring: a costume (required!)\, comfy dancing s
 hoes 👟\, water 💧\, something that glows ✨\, and your best wobble. 
 Spoons encouraged 🥄 🙌\nWANT TO CONTRIBUTE? DanceoWeen is made by the
  people who show up. DM @danceoween on Instagram if you’ve got: 🔊 A s
 ound cart (or a DJ\, band or speaker on wheels) to join the parade 🚧 He
 lp with traffic blocking\, keeping crossings safe so the mob can move\n
 🎁 A fun surprise experience to bring peo...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https:/
