 er Sunset Farmers Market and Mercantile on November 1st from 9am to 2pm to
  shop local produce\, goods\, prepared food\, and more then dive into the 
 celebration and themed activities. All are invited to make an ofrenda/alta
 r table or contribute to our community ofrenda!\nSunday\, November 1\, 202
