DESCRIPTION:Tenderloin Community Benefit District\, Into The Streets SF & 
 Civic Joy Fund present\nTenderloin Street Fair: Día de Muertos Celebratio
 n 2026\nSunday\, November 1 | Golden Gate btwn. Larkin & Jones\n\nDía de 
 Muertos comes to the Tenderloin Street Fair!\n\nJoin us Sunday\, November 
 1 from 2–8 PM for a FREE street fair takeover in the heart of the Tender
 loin\, bringing together the traditions of Día de Muertos with a family-f
 riendly block party for everyone.\n\nA full day of live FREE Latin music i
 n the streets\, from música mexicana and mariachi to cumbia\, salsa\, Lat
 in rock and more: Agua Pura brings the salsa\, Combo Tezeta gets psychedel
 ic with Peruvian cumbia\, chicha and música tropical\, and Soucano serves
  up Latin rock and soul—plus música mexicana from Rica Montes\, Banda L
 a Tóxica\, Mariachi Tradición Mexicana and Trio Sol de México.\n\nMain 
 Stage\n\n2:00–3:00 PM — Soucano\n3:30–4:30 PM — Agua Pura\n5:30–
 6:30 PM — Combo Tezeta\n7:00–8:00 PM — Banda La Toxica\n\nLucha Libr
 e Stage\n\n2:15–3:15 PM — Farsante\n3:45–4:45 PM — El Rica Montes\
 nIn between luchas — Sonido Killer\n\nRooted in the traditions of San Fr
 ancisco’s diverse Latino communities\, the celebration invites everyone 
 to honor the holiday with ofrendas\, enjoy delicious food\, and celebrate 
 life through music\, dance\, community\, and friends.\n\nFill the streets 
 with us for live music\, lucha libre\, local food and vendors\, a Kids Zon
 e\, face painting\, arts + crafts\, Lotería\, hands-on cultural activitie
 s\, an outdoor bar\, and more.\n\nBring your family\, b...\n\nFree\nTender
 loin Community Benefit District\, Into The Streets SF & Civic Joy Fund pre
 sent\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventb
 rite.com%2Fe%2Ftenderloin-street-fair-presents-dia-de-muertos-celebration-
 2026-tickets-2002305378287%3Faff%3Daffiliate3\nDetails: https://dothebay.c
 om/events/2026/11/1/tenderloin-street-fair-dia-de-muertos-celebration-2026
