DESCRIPTION:Brava Presents\n\nNovember 1\, 2026\n\n10:00AM Altares Viewing
 \n\nShowtimes: 2:00PM & 6:00PM\n\nBrava Main Stage\n\nSF Loco Bloco dancer
 s\, drummers & band Cuicacalli Dance Company Lanakila Mangauil Ho’a Hawa
 ii Christelle Durandy Odoiya Women's Chorus and the Sweet Xequere Big star
  circus.\n\nEarly Bird Pricing Ends 10/17 @12:00PM:\n\nEarly Bird General 
 Admission: $20\n\nEarly Bird Youth/Student Admission (Valid ID Required): 
 $12\n\nAfter 10/17 @12:00PM Pricing:\n\nRegular General Admission: $25\n\n
 Regular Youth/Student Admission (Valid ID Required): $15\n\nStep into a li
 ving ofrenda! In partnership with Brava Theater\, Loco Bloco presents “E
 sto No Se Vende\,” an electrifying Día de los Muertos celebration where
  live music\, dance\, ceremony\, and storytelling ignite the stage. Bay Ar
 ea artists and communities come together to honor our ancestors\, celebrat
 e resilience\, and move toward new life.\n\n“Esto No Se Vende” (This W
 e Do Not Sell) celebrates Dia de los Muertos at the historic Brava Theater
  in the Latino Cultural District of San Francisco. Produced by Loco Bloco\
 , this annual event offers unique interpretations of Dia de los Muertos th
 emes by artists from Mexican\, Central American\, African-American\, Carib
 bean and other communities rooted in San Francisco and the Bay Area. Mains
 tage performers include: Loco Bloco Performing Ensemble\, Cuicacalli Dance
  Company\, Christelle Durandy\, Lanakila Manguail and Odoiya Women’s Cho
 rus.\n\nOn this sacred day\, Brava Theater transforms to a living “ofren
 da” with altares b...\n\n$20\, $25\n\nTickets: https://brava.my.salesfor
 ce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SPa00000dhKTFMA2\nDetails: https://dothebay
 .com/events/2026/11/1/loco-bloco-presents-dia-de-los-muertos-2026-esto-no-
 se-vende-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
