DESCRIPTION:SF’s Free “Sundays at the Beach” Chair Yoga Day (Great H
 ighway)\nGreat Highway Park\nWelcome to Sundays at the Beach!\nWith help f
 rom @avenuegreenlight and our friends across the neighborhood\, we’re ex
 cited to bring free community events to Great Highway Park every weekend f
