DESCRIPTION:Tenderloin Street Fair\n\nA free Día de Muertos street fair b
 ringing tradition and block party energy to the heart of San Francisco’s
  Tenderloin.\n\nDía de Muertos comes to the Tenderloin Street Fair!\nJoin
  us Sunday\, November 1 from 2–8 PM for a street fair takeover in the he
 art of the Tenderloin\, bringing together the traditions of Día de Muerto
 s with a family-friendly block party for everyone.\n\nA full day of live F
 REE Latin music in the streets\, from música mexicana and mariachi to cum
 bia\, salsa\, Latin rock and more: Agua Pura brings the salsa\, Combo Teze
 ta gets psychedelic with Peruvian cumbia\, chicha and música tropical\, a
 nd Soucano serves up Latin rock and soul—plus música mexicana from Rica
  Montes\, Banda La Tóxica\, Mariachi Tradición Mexicana and Trio Sol de 
 México.\nMain Stage\n\n2:00–3:00 PM — Soucano\n3:30–4:30 PM — Agu
 a Pura\n5:30–6:30 PM — Combo Tezeta\n7:00–8:00 PM — Banda La Toxic
 a\n\nLucha Libre Stage\n\n2:15–3:15 PM — Farsante\n3:45–4:45 PM — 
 El Rica Montes\nIn between luchas — Sonido Killer\n\nRooted in the tradi
 tions of San Francisco’s diverse Latino communities\, the celebration in
 vites everyone to honor the holiday with ofrendas\, enjoy delicious food\,
  and celebrate life through music\, dance\, community\, and friends.\nFill
  the streets with us for live music\, lucha libre\, local food and vendors
 \, a Kids Zone\, face painting\, arts + crafts\, Lotería\, hands-on cultu
 ral activities\, an outdoor bar\, and more.\nBring your family\, bring you
 r friends\, and join us in making this yearly tradit...\n\nFree\n\nTickets
 : https://www.eventbrite.com/e/tenderloin-street-fair-presents-dia-de-muer
 tos-celebration-2026-tickets-2002305378287?aff=erelpanelorg\nDetails: http
 s://sf.funcheap.com/tenderloin-street-fair-dia-de-muertos-celebration-2026
 -block-party-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
