 n7:00-8:00 PM - Bachata lesson\; beginners welcome and no partner needed.\
 n8:00-11:00 PM - Social dancing with DJs spinning Bachata favorites.\n\nAd
 vance registration is $8\; walk-ins are $10. Food\, craft cocktails\, wine
 \, beer\, and fine cigars are available for\npurchase. Jose Santamaria is 
