 erience teaching and researching Latin dance techniques.\n\nVenue: Cigar B
 ar & Grill\, 850 Montgomery St.\, San Francisco.\n\nNO REFUNDS - Must be 2
 1+\n\n$8 advance\; $10 walk-in\nCigar Bar & Grill PRESENTS:\n\nTickets: ht
