DESCRIPTION:VOON Wines Presents\nVOON 54: A Studio 54 Harvest Party with V
 OON Wines\nSaturday\, November 7 | W San Francisco\n\nDisco never left. Ne
 ither did great wine.'\n\nVOON 54: Studio 54 glamour meets harvest season\
 , one unforgettable night at W San Francisco.\n\nVOON 54: A Studio 54 Harv
 est Party with VOON Wines\n\nStep into the disco. VOON Wines invites you t
 o VOON 54\, a night of glitter\, groove\, and great wine\, celebrating thi
 s year's harvest in true Studio 54 fashion.\n\nHosted in partnership with 
 W San Francisco\, VOON 54 brings together our community for an evening of 
 dancing\, DJ sets\, live music\, and pours from our latest harvest. Expect
  velvet disco vibes\, a dance floor that doesn't quit\, all wrapped in the
  glamour of one of the most iconic nightlife eras.\n\nFeaturing:\n\nWines 
 by VOON Wines (@voonwines)\nDJing by DJ Maximilian and DJ Questy!\nLive pe
 rformances by Bay Area favorites Analog Dog\, Cardboard People\, and Hugo 
 de la Lune!\n\nCome dressed to dazzle. Sequins\, silk\, gold\, and glam ar
 e all welcome (and encouraged).\n\nEvent Details:\n\nSaturday\, November 7
 th\n7:00 PM – 11:00 PM (The Living Room bar at W will be open after)\nW 
 San Francisco — 181 3rd Street\, SOMA\n$18 per ticket (entry only — wi
 ne available for purchase on-site)\n21+ event\, valid ID required\nFeaturi
 ng VOON Wines' latest harvest\nLive music + DJs all night\nStudio 54 dress
  code encouraged\nVIP guest room rates at W San Francisco for those stayin
 g the night!\nJoin us to toast the season\, the community\, and the vines 
 that made it all po...\n\n$18\, 21+\nVOON Wines Presents\n\nTickets: https
 ://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2Fvoon-54
 -a-studio-54-harvest-party-with-voon-wines-tickets-2000671836319%3Faff%3Dd
