DESCRIPTION:Dugoni School of DentistryGive Veterans A Smile is free of cha
 rge for veterans and active-duty members of the United States’ armed for
 ces\n• Free screenings\, including dental X-rays\; teeth\, gum and tissu
 e checks\; blood pressure and glucose testing\; and oral cancer screenings
 \n• Get your questions answered by University of the Pacific dental prof
 essionals\n• Learn how you can become a patient and get discounted denta
 l care\n• Free health goody bags\n• Snacks and refreshments\n• Fully
  ADA-compliant and wheelchair-friendly clinic\n*Please bring your DD214 an
 d your photo ID to your appointment. DD214s will be requested on site to p
 rove veteran eligibility. An electronic copy of the DD214 will be accepted
  with photo I.D.\nAppointments are required.\n\nRSVP ONLINE HERE: https://
 dentalpacific.az1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0I0VNPrki7Xrdgq\nOr to RSVP ca
 ll 415.780.2055 or email pr@pacific.edu\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://dental
 pacific.az1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_0I0VNPrki7Xrdgq\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/veterans-day-freebie-free-dental-screenings-xrays-veterans-s
