BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Holy Wave
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261111T210000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17409510@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:In Ensenada\, Mexico\, where the Pacific horizon cuts a clean\
 , unwavering line\, Holy Wave recorded their latest full length\, i’m DA
 DA\, a record that feels both expansive and newly concentrated for the sub
 terranean pop four-piece. Stepping outside the United States was less a re
 treat than a shift in perspective\, creating distance to recognize a new s
 ound that had been slowly taking shape among them. i’m DADA quickly reve
 aled its character: more propulsive\, more candid\, and their most structu
 rally deliberate work to date.\n\nWorking alongside experimental duo Lorel
 le Meets the Obsolete at their studio El Derrumbe the sessions folded comm
 unity into the album\, though its emotional core had already formed over m
 onths of pre-production. Half of Holy Wave is Mexican\, with roots in the 
 El Paso border region\, so recording in Ensenada felt intuitive and relaxe
 d. Joo Joo Ashworth\, mixing engineer and longtime friend\, also provided 
 a pivotal presence helping crystallize the album’s rhythmic language and
  subtly expanding the band’s sound. The songs began reflecting conversat
 ions about fatherhood and partnership\, breakups and estrangement\, the qu
 easy acceleration of AI\, and what it means to remain present and principl
 ed while the world lurches unpredictably forward.\n\nPresented by Kilowatt
 .\n\nThis is a 21+ event\n\n$24.72\, 21+\nPresented by Kilowatt.\n\nTicket
 s: https://link.dice.fm/Y5fe9e3cffee?pid=717f1d8a\nDetails: https://dotheb
 ay.com/events/2026/11/11/holy-wave-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7650767;-122.423278
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/32366787/589bad12-3d2a-444e-bcad-a07f59e8945a.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Kilowatt\, 3160 16th St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/11/holy-wave-tickets
END:VEVENT
