SUMMARY:Candlelight: Tribute to Michael Jackson
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T203000
DTSTAMP:20261023T171442Z
UID:dothebay-17979536@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Variety
DESCRIPTION:November 13\, 2026 @6:30PM\n\nBrava Theater\n\nCelebrate the K
 ing of Pop's legendary career through a collection of his greatest hits. F
 rom Billie Jean to Thriller and Man in the Mirror\, rediscover Michael Jac
 kson's unforgettable music through the warm glow of Candlelight!\n\nThis c
 oncert experience is a tribute. It is not associated with\, endorsed by or
  sponsored by the artist\, their heirs or their official representatives.\
 n\nProgramme: I Want You Back\, Rock With You\, Human Nature\, Billie Jean
 \, Say Say Say\, We Are the World\, Man in the Mirror\, Smooth Criminal\, 
 Black or White\, Heal the World\, Remember the Time\, Bad\, Earth Song\, T
 hey Don't Really Care About Us and Thriller.\n\nPerformers: September 12 -
  Listeso\; String Quartet\; Range Ensemble String Quartet.\n\nVenue: Brava
  Theater Center\n\nDates and times: select your dates/times directly in th
 e ticket selector\n\nDuration: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before th
 e show. No entry once it starts\n\nAge requirement: 8 years old or older. 
 Anyone under the age of 16 must be accompanied by an adult\n\nAccessibilit
 y: the venue is ADA compliant\n\nView the FAQs for this event here\n\nSeat
 ing is assigned on a first come first served basis in each zone\n\nCheck o
 ut all the Candlelight concerts in San Francisco\n\nTentative Program\n\nI
  Want You Back\n\nRock With You\n\nHuman Nature\n\nBillie Jean\n\nSay Say 
