 mission is first come first served\nLike most comedy clubs\, there is a tw
 o-drink minimum to help support the bar and waitstaff\n\nLike all things i
 n life\, the comedy lineup is subject to change.\n———-\n$20 TIX AVAI
 LABLE (50) AT DOOR – When Advanced Tix are sold out\n\nAbout The Functio
 n\nIntroducing The Function\, a vibrant addition to the city’s entertain
 ment scene\, where laughter reigns supreme and every night is a celebratio
