DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, November 13\, from 5–8 pm\, Fulton Plaza will co
 me alive beneath the dazzling SPECTRA lights for the holiday season’s Pe
 rforming Arts Showcase\, a celebration bringing together some of downtown
 ’s most exciting performing arts organizations for one unforgettable eve
 ning.\nGuests will be treated to a dynamic lineup of live performances of 
 what’s on stage Fall 2026-Winter 2027. Expect short works from the San F
 rancisco Opera\, San Francisco Ballet\, San Francisco Conservatory of Musi
 c\, the African American Shakespeare Company\, RAWdance\, and more. From p
 owerful voices and sweeping orchestral music to captivating movement and t
 heatrical performances\, the showcase offers a little bit of everything 
 — and is a memorable way to launch the holiday season.\nThis event is fr
 ee\, RSVP here.\nThe event will also feature a post-show reception with an
  opportunity to mingle with the performing arts organizations\, ticket sal
 es\, ticket raffles from the SF Symphony and Orpheum Theatre\, and bites a
 nd drinks for purchase.\n\nThank you to event sponsors: Avenue Greenlight\
 , Civic Center Community Benefit District\, Illuminate\, and the San Franc
 isco Public Library\n\nPublished by SF Civic Center\nContains information 
 from CalDiscovery (caldiscovery.com)\, ODbL 1.0\n\nDetails: https://sfcivi
 ccenter.org/event/holiday-season-performing-arts-showcase/?utm_source=cald
 iscovery&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=san-francisco-ca\nSource: CalDiscover
 y
