UID:dothebay-17813444@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:Singer-songwriter Duane Forrest performs acoustic renditions o
 f legendary reggae songs—from Bob Marley to Toots and the Maytals—that
  reshaped countless lives\, including his own. This uplifting show earned 
 five stars from Broadway Baby\, sold out at the 2024 Edinburgh Fringe\, an
 d won the Jury’s Choice Award at the Ottawa Fringe Festival\, Patron’s
