 sdom over ignorance. In today's changing world "Time of Transformation" in
 vites us to awaken our inner light and foster peace across all communities
  and traditions.\n\nEvent Highlights:\n♦ Inspiring reflections and Inter
 faith Prayers\n♦ Special Guest: BK Gayatri Naraine\, UN Representative\,
