 ce written and directed by Dr. Andrei Antokhin\, University of San Francis
 co\n♦ Artistic Performances and Live Music\n♦ Guided Meditation\n♦ V
 egetarian Dinner and warm community connections\n\nDetails:\n• REGISTRAT
 ION REQUIRED\n• Doors open 5:00 PM\n• Everyone welcome to attend\n• 
 Festive/Formal attire\n• No prior meditation experience required\n\nCome
