SUMMARY:An Evening with a Mentalist: Jay Alexander's Mind Tricks Live
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T200000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:caldiscovery-comedy-32657c99e0ee7204@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:comedy
DESCRIPTION:Category: Art / Photography / CraftsContact Name: Jay Weisberg
 Contact Phone: 415-305-6893Contact Email: mar@jayalexander.comCost: Genera
 l Admission: USD 55.00Link: https://go.evvnt.com/3848473-2?pid=12352At the
  San Francisco Magic Theater\, we don't give you a "show." We hand you an 
 experience... a carefully engineered collision of impossible mentalism\, l
 augh-out-loud comedy\, and illusions that punch through the wall of your r
 eality.What You'll DoStep off the streets of SF and into our historic Moro
 ccan-inspired speakeasy\, you will enjoy handcrafted cocktails\, Moroccan 
 appetizers\, and live close-up magic.Then enter our jewel-box theater for 
