 t have a ticket. Children under the age of 12 must be seated with an accom
 panying adult.\n\nArtists\n\nSarah Hicks\, Conductor\nSan Francisco Sympho
 ny\n\nProgram\n\nDanny Elfman\, Composer\nHenry Selick\, Director\n\nThe F
 ilm Series is presented in honor of Misty Tyree\, whose remarkable legacy 
