 – Now at City Hall features\, “an exhibition that celebrates the histo
 ry of Muni and the evolution of our city with a collection of images from 
 the SFMTA Photo Archive.” From the Francisco Arts Commission (SFAC)\, in
  partnership with the San Francisco Municipal Transportation Agency’s (S
 FMTA) Photo Archive\, Moving San Francisco will be on display on the Groun
 d Floor and North Light Court at City Hall through November 25\, 2026.\n\n
