DESCRIPTION:Join us this Thanksgiving as we bring warmth\, joy\, and holid
 ay meals to older adults in our community! There are two ways you can volu
 nteer:\n\nOption 1: In-Person Visit & Meal Delivery\n- Pick up your Thanks
 giving meal(s) in downtown San Francisco on Thursday\, November 26th betwe
 en 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM.\n- Deliver the meal(s) and spend time visiting w
 ith an older adult in their home.\n- Visits and deliveries should be compl
 eted between 10:30 AM – 12:30 PM.\n- Exact meal pick-up location will be
  shared in your confirmation email.\n\nOption 2: Meal Delivery Only\n- Pic
 k up meals in downtown San Francisco on Thursday\, November 26th between 1
 0:00 AM – 12:00 PM.\n- Deliver meals to multiple older adults who have r
 equested delivery only (no in-home visit).\n- Deliveries should be complet
 ed between 10:30 AM – 12:30 PM.\n- Exact pick-up location will be shared
  in your confirmation email.\n\nAdditional Details\n- Family and friends a
 re welcome to join you! At least one person in each group must have a clea
 red background check and volunteer orientation.\n\nSign up today to make T
 hanksgiving brighter for older adults in San Francisco! https://www.little
 brotherssf.org/volunteer#volunteerform\n\nFree\nLBFE PRESENTS:\n\nTickets:
  https://www.littlebrotherssf.org/volunteer#volunteerform\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/11/26/thanksgiving-in-home-visits-meal-deliveri
 es-to-sf-older-adults-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
