SUMMARY:Mannheim Steamroller Christmas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261207T210000
DTSTAMP:20261008T185326Z
UID:dothebay-17731716@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Mannheim Steamroller Christmas by Chip Davis has been America'
 s favorite holiday tradition for 40 years!\n\nClosed\n\nGrammy Award winne
 r Chip Davis has created a show that features Mannheim Steamroller Christm
 as classics in the distinctive Mannheim sound.\n\nThe program celebrates t
 he anniversary of 40 years since the first Christmas album and includes da
